<!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="sh-top"><span class="sec-no">(01)</span><span>HOW IT WORKS</span><span class="sh-rule"></span></div>
      <h2>Three steps. <em class="grad">Your files stay put.</em></h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Set up your self-hosted gallery, connect the media you already own, and start rediscovering your memories. No cloud account required for local browsing.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="step rv">
        <div class="s-no">01</div>
        <div class="s-body">
          <h3>Install Foldergram</h3>
          <p>Run Foldergram on your own hardware with Docker Compose. Download the provided Compose file, configure your gallery path, and start the container. The image includes everything needed for local photo and video processing.</p>
          <a class="step-link" href="https://docs.foldergram.app/installation" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow the installation guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="s-vig">
          <div class="vig-source">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="18" height="8" rx="2"/><path d="M7 7h.01M7 17h.01M11 7h6M11 17h6"/></svg>
            <div><strong>Docker Compose</strong><span>docker-compose.yml</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="vig-note">Open localhost:4141 on the Docker host after setup.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="step rv" style="--d:.08s">
        <div class="s-no">02</div>
        <div class="s-body">
          <h3>Connect your library</h3>
          <p>Use the photos and videos on your local disks, NAS or external drives. Add more locations in Settings → Sources, or connect an existing Immich library. Foldergram indexes your media without moving your local originals.</p>
          <a class="step-link" href="https://docs.foldergram.app/local-galleries" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Local galleries <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="step-link" href="https://docs.foldergram.app/immich" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Immich integration <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="s-vig">
          <div class="vig-source">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5.5 5h4l2 2.5h7A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 21 10v7.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 18.5 20h-13A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 3 17.5v-10Z"/></svg>
            <div><strong>Local folders</strong><span>/mnt/nas/photos/</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="vig-source">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="3"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="9" r="1.5"/><path d="m3 17 5-5 4 4 4-6 5 6"/></svg>
            <div><strong>Immich</strong><span>Optional · read-only</span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="vig-note">Multiple sources, one combined feed.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="step rv" style="--d:.16s">
        <div class="s-no">03</div>
        <div class="s-body">
          <h3>Rediscover your memories</h3>
          <p>Once your library is indexed, browse your own feed in Recent, Rediscover or Random mode. Watch videos in Reels, revisit Stories and Moments, explore folder profiles, and save your favorites.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="s-vig">
          <div class="vig-rings">
            <span class="ap-story"><span class="ring"><img src="demo-media/st-tigers-0.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="ap-sname">Recent Batches</span></span>
            <span class="ap-story"><span class="ring"><img src="demo-media/st-lions-0.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="ap-sname">Deep Cuts</span></span>
            <span class="ap-story"><span class="ring"><img src="demo-media/st-season-0.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="ap-sname">Lucky Dip</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="vig-reelchip">
            <span class="vbadge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5Z"/></svg>0:12</span>
            <span>indexed videos appear in the Reels player</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
